  "body": "**Wanted:** from one closed shape, generate a V-carved pocket and a mirrored V-carved plug with a stated glue gap and start depth, so the two fit. The pair is verified together. It waits on V-carve (#1443) and the flat-tip question (#895).\n\n**Done means:** an inlay pair from one shape posts two programs whose simulated fit matches the stated allowance, pinned by tests.\n\nPart of #3066 (findings: https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/issues/3066#issuecomment-7050655107). The clean-room boundary of #3066 applies: no vendor wording, labels, parameter names or dialog flows.",
